# Trail test on fibs and trendlines (2026-09-01 to now)

Same filled trades scored two ways, net after fees: live = the live rules (fib 2R + BE, TL candle stop + 1R); trail = stop follows 0.25R behind the best price once +0.5R traded, no target, out at the stop or the 20th candle's close. % = R x the trade's stop distance. Trades filled within 15 min of US CPI/PPI/FOMC left out.

Variants: tA/B = trail starts at +A R, B R behind the best price; +NR = also a target at N R.

